# TMDB credential: the long "API Read Access Token" or the short 32-character API key; the script
# takes either (D-47). Build time only; never exposed to the browser (D-09).
# Get one free at themoviedb.org > Settings > API (non-commercial use, with attribution).
TMDB_READ_TOKEN=

# User agent for polite fetches (D-08). Keep the contact URL.
FETCH_USER_AGENT="SinimaBot/0.1 (+https://github.com/ChimeXXD/sinima)"
